{"ID":"20240118151240-fn79ocr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151240-fn79ocr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151240-fn79ocr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151240-mt1h2c8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122111230-1ijxo3l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122111230-1ijxo3l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:294,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:294\u0026#125;","title":"112发髲bì（头发）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903102715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151240-mt1h2c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151240-mt1h2c8","updated":"20240122111102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦温，主五癃关格不通，利小便水道。疗小儿痫，大人痓，仍自还神化。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111106-v8fpg3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111106-v8fpg3r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】乃人身头上之发也，处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111108-krbhz70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111108-krbhz70"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111109-p687gfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111109-p687gfl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】发髲主益阴泄热，治小便不利，五癃关格，小儿惊痫，血闷血晕，去瘀血，止好血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111112-n8e2ays","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111112-n8e2ays"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】合鸡子黄煎之消积水，疗小儿惊热百病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111113-4n3cqzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111113-4n3cqzq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】止血闷血运金疮伤风血痢，入药烧存性用，煎膏长肉，消瘀血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111115-8thrv0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111115-8thrv0w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】乱发烧灰，疗转胞小便不通，赤白痢，痈肿疔肿骨疽。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111116-29yi6xt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111116-29yi6xt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】乱发消瘀血，止舌血，补阴甚捷。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111117-9vai9aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111117-9vai9aq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通三五分。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111118-eodqgy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111118-eodqgy4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】发灰气味不佳，胃弱者勿服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111102-lps5l2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111102-lps5l2o"}},{"ID":"20240122111221-w7ebtn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111221-w7ebtn3","updated":"20240130103633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第112，我们这个叫发髲，什么叫发髲，就是你的头发，是还是粗粗都有啦，所以我们第15去捡个假发，啊，捡错了。当然有的假发是真发做的。头发的味道很臭啊。这个经方里面我们会用到头发，猪油，猪膏，头发煎在一起，猪油在锅子里滚的时候，头发“哧……”一下就没了，猪膏。按张仲景的说法是治诸黄，不管是什么样的黄疸都能够治，你就知道那头发有多厉害。"}]},{"ID":"20240122111221-us55wsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111221-us55wsm","updated":"20240130103817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"头发我们知道是血之余，头发为血余，你烧过以后就叫血余碳。那真的不好吃，你不相信就把自己的头发剪来试试看，要制过，你的头发如果是生的吃下去不得了，它在里面消化不掉啊，头发很厉害，消化不掉就打在一起，结在一起，很麻烦的啊。那还是有方法的了，过去孙思邈用酸菜，那个腌的酸菜，那个发结在里面，清不出来，那酸菜保证，那个酸菜又酸又咸又臭，“哇----”一下就吐出来，所以就吐出来了。头发结在里面，那头发不好消化，不要随便拿起来吃，一定要炸过，一定要在油里面炸过再吃。吃了这个药，利小便非常的凶悍。"}]},{"ID":"20240122111230-1ijxo3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111230-1ijxo3l","updated":"20240130103925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们看，【主治】这个发髲，主治癕泻热，滋阴的主要去热，小便不利的，五癃关格，就是水排不出来，除淤血。那如果是和鸡蛋黄煎在一起就很好吃啊，有那个鸡蛋很好吃的，消积的。当你如果说遇到病人有水肿的时候，你可以用猪油，诸症发黄啊，你不要管里面是什么，水肿里面发黄啊，拿猪油，头发要自己剪下来，自己把头发剪下来，放在里面炸，然后就煎个荷包蛋给他吃，利水。因为它是血之余，煎过碳化过以后，煎过以后活血化瘀的力量很强，那吃下去过个几分钟就晓得啦，你不要以为，“老师，这个没有什么”，彪悍啊，这个头发很好用。你看朱丹溪：乱发消淤血止舌头出血，除淤的效果很快，滋阴的效果很快，本来头发就是血之余气生的，那味道非常的温，辛，辛温，苦味，味道非常的苦。"}]}]}